// Feature 15/25 — TAX REGIME ELECTION POLICY. The employer's per-FY income-tax regime
// stance: the DEFAULT regime an un-elected employee falls back to (getEffectiveRegime),
// the optional election WINDOW (employees may self-elect only between electionOpenFrom
// and electionLockDate), and a global LOCK (lockedGlobally) that freezes all elections
// for the FY at once. Tenant-walled; one row per (businessId, fy). The per-EMPLOYEE lock
// signal lives on StatutoryProfile.regimeLockedAt (set when HR finalises an individual /
// the window closes). Additive — nothing about the existing withholding math changes;
// the resolver simply falls back to defaultRegime when the profile is silent.
model TaxRegimePolicy {
  id               String      @id @default(uuid())
  businessId       String
  business         Business    @relation(fields: [businessId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
